\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces The paper's three claims with their evidence and their strength, and then the three readings we do \emph  {not} claim. The rows are ordered by how far each travels: C1 holds for the cells we evaluate, C2 for the screen at the threshold we state, C3 for any study that reads a post-treatment similarity statistic as evidence about a treatment's value. The three N rows are not hedges: each is a proposition this paper's own evidence is insufficient to support, and two of them would be supported by results we report if the scope restriction were dropped.}}{16}{table.caption.6}\protected@file@percent }
