\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {12}{\ignorespaces The strict-freeze control (condition~H) beside condition~D on sixteen cells: the six that met the degradation definition under the superseded trend baseline, plus ILI, plus the five gate-passing survivors of \S  \ref {sec:forecasting:results}, plus all four Moirai/ETTm2 value-cells. \textbf  {B$-$H keeps B$-$D's sign on twelve and reverses it on all four ETTm2 cells}, where condition~D's margin was the input projection re-fitting rather than the encoder being held still. B$-$D is restricted to the seeds condition~H ran, and a cell with fewer than three H seeds is excluded and named by the emitter rather than printed thin. $n$ is shown on every row and is not constant down the column; ILI's $452$ is its whole training split rather than a cap (Table~\ref {tab:heldout_all}). Generated by \texttt  {scripts/cell\_matrix.py --latex}.}}{28}{table.caption.23}\protected@file@percent }
